Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.00,0:05:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,《生化危机：终章》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.35,0:01:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,都说历史是胜利者书写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say that history is written by the victors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那么  这就是保护伞公司的历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This then, is the history of the Umbrella Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,由激进的科学家詹姆斯·马库斯成立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Formed by crusading scientist, Professor James Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.63,0:01:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,马库斯有一个小女儿  艾丽西娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marcus had a young daughter, Alicia,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.85,0:01:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,得了早衰症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}afflicted with progeria,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.42,0:01:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,一种无法治愈  不断恶化的致命疾病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a progressive, fatal, wasting disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,早衰症导致她过早地衰老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Progeria caused premature aging.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.15,0:01:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,到她25岁时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the time she was 25,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.11,0:01:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽西娅的身体却已经90岁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alicia would have the body of a 90 year old.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.46,0:01:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,马库斯一心想要救她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marcus was driven to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但机会渺茫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the odds seemed impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.15,0:01:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,在他拼命研究治疗方法的同时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And even as he worked desperately to create a cure,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.74,0:01:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,小女孩的父亲记录下了他的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the young girl's father would record his daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:02:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,她的声音  样貌  为后世保存起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}her voice, her likeness, saving her for posterity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.10,0:02:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但接着研究就有了突破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then a breakthrough came.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.65,0:02:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,马库斯发现了T病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marcus discovered the T-Virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.41,0:02:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,一经注射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once injected, it would
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.65,0:02:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,它就会发现并修复体内的受损细胞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}detect and repair damaged cells within the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是个奇迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.93,0:02:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽西娅·马库斯得救了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The life of Alicia Marcus was saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.50,0:02:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,T病毒的作用不可限量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The T-Virus had a myriad of applications,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.98,0:02:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,能治愈上千种不同疾病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}treating a thousand different diseases.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.27,0:02:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一夜之间  世界似乎进入了新纪元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Overnight, it seemed a new era was dawning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.09,0:02:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,一个不再畏惧感染  疾病和衰老的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A world without the fear of infection, sickness or decay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.86,0:02:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但它并非如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it was not to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.50,0:02:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,T病毒还有未曾预见的副作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the T-Virus had certain, unforeseen side effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.55,0:02:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,老师  这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, sir, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.79,0:02:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他没呼吸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.91,0:03:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,第一个僵尸诞生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first of the undead was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.01,0:03:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,事故很快被掩盖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The incident was quickly covered up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.18,0:03:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,之后  詹姆斯·马库斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the aftermath, James Marcus
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.90,0:03:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,与他的商业伙伴激烈争辩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}argued furiously with his business partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.34,0:03:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,亚历山大·艾萨克斯博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Alexander Isaacs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.38,0:03:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在乎代价有多大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care how much it costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.11,0:03:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须停止这个项目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to close the program down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯  那样我们就完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, we're gonna be ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.90,0:03:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我心意已决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mind is made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.51,0:03:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.93,0:03:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,回床上去  艾丽西娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Off to bed, Alicia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:03:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲和我只是在谈话而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father and I are just talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.53,0:04:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.34,0:04:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,艾萨克斯博士监护起他死去的合伙人的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Isaacs became the guardian of his dead partner's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.49,0:04:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,于是属于她的半个公司也落入他手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And her half of the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,公司开始滋生诸多傲慢的理想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The corporation that had begun with such lofty ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,完全为贪婪与权力所引诱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had been seduced completely by greed, and power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.53,0:04:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,为了帮助他控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To help him control the now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.81,0:04:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,保护伞公司现在的巨大利益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}vast interests of the Umbrella Corporation,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.76,0:04:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,艾萨克斯博士创造了一个强大的人工智能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Isaacs created a powerful artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.18,0:04:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,艾萨克斯用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isaacs used the likeness
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.39,0:04:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽西娅·马库斯的样貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Alicia Marcus
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.19,0:04:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,作为计算机的交互界面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the computer's interface.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.45,0:04:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,艾萨克斯把这台计算机叫做红后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isaacs called the computer The Red Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.27,0:04:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,接着  十年前  在浣熊市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, 10 years ago in Raccoon City,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.75,0:04:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,一场生化危机爆发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there was an outbreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.38,0:04:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,T病毒从一处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The T-virus escaped from
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.79,0:04:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,叫做蜂巢的地下实验室外泄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an underground laboratory called The Hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.75,0:04:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,美国政府试图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The American government attempted
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.99,0:04:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,通过投放炸弹控制危机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to contain the outbreak by detonating a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这摧毁了浣熊市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It devastated Raccoon City.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.21,0:05:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但它没能阻止空气传播感染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it couldn't stop the airborne infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.69,0:05:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,病毒爆发在几天内传遍全球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The viral outbreak spread across the world within days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.36,0:05:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,人类倒在病毒脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humankind was brought to its knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.78,0:05:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,最终  人类最后也是最大的希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally, the last and best hope of humanity,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.22,0:05:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,聚集在一起  在华盛顿特区背水一战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gathered and took a last stand in Washington DC.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.66,0:05:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们并没有意识到我们步入的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we didn't realize that what we had walked into...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.83,0:05:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是个圈套  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.15,0:05:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫爱丽丝  这是我的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Alice. And this is my story.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.74,0:05:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我故事的结局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The end... of my story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.31,0:08:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,(克莱莫杀伤地雷  杀伤性)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.19,0:11:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,(爱丽丝计划)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.75,0:12:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.07,0:12:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,还有人活着吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anyone alive in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.30,0:12:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.07,0:13:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,(你好爱丽丝)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.51,0:13:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来幸灾乐祸的吗  - 我的卫星显示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You come here to gloat? -  My satellites show
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.93,0:13:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,地球表面还有4472名人类存活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there are 4,472 humans remaining on the surface of the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.96,0:13:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他们将会在48小时内消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will cease to exist in under 48 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.87,0:13:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要我怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.37,0:13:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,要我说你赢了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want me to say that you've won?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.69,0:13:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你灭绝了人类  - 不  恰恰相反\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You've wiped out humanity. -  No. Quite the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.63,0:14:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你阻止我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.87,0:14:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,小心身后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.18,0:14:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 干得漂亮  - 我不相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nicely done. -  I don't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.85,0:14:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,鉴于我们的过往  你相信我才惊讶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Given our history, I'd be surprised if you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.63,0:14:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但除非你介入  否则我将完成屠杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But unless you intervene, the slaughter will be complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 地球再无一人幸存  - 我怎么可能救得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There will be no survivors. -  How can I possibly help them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.53,0:14:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,保护伞研究出了一种空气传播的病毒抗体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Umbrella developed an airborne antivirus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.09,0:14:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,释放抗体  那么一经接触\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If released, it would destroy the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.75,0:14:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,它就会摧毁T病毒及其感染过的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}T-Virus and anything it has infected on contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.08,0:14:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这一切就可以结束了  - 正是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All this could end? -  Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.87,0:14:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,病毒抗体在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is this antivirus?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.31,0:14:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,在浣熊市地下  蜂巢里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beneath the streets of Raccoon City, in the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.67,0:14:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.88,0:14:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我的程序不允许我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My programming will not allow me to harm
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.10,0:14:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,伤害保护伞公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Umbrella Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.63,0:14:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但你不受此限制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you are bound by no such constraints.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:14:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你要对抗保护伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd turn against Umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.55,0:15:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,对抗创造了你的人  为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Against the people who created you? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.62,0:15:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,在48小时内赶到浣熊市  进入蜂巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to Raccoon City in 48 hours. Make it to the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.08,0:15:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,答案就在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then you'll have your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.61,0:15:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有理由相信你说的任何话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no reason to believe a word you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.77,0:15:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  但我能给你一样你很想要的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}True. But I can offer you something you want very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.27,0:15:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么  - 复仇  威斯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is that? -  Revenge. Wesker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他一路将你引来华盛顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He led you all here to Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.90,0:15:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,假装把你的能力还给了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He pretended to give you your powers back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,接着  他背叛了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then, he betrayed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.78,0:15:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.28,0:15:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他刚刚抵达蜂巢  我正在重置你的手表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just landed at the Hive. I'm resetting your watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.81,0:15:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,时间紧迫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The clock is ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.40,0:15:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.64,0:15:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,十年前在蜂巢  我们都失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten years ago in the Hive, we both failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.01,0:15:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是我们造成了这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We let this happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.68,0:15:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这次纠正它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.81,0:15:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,(生化人爱丽丝)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.59,0:16:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,(浣熊市418英里)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.23,0:17:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,(保护伞公司)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.85,0:18:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你就这点能耐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that all you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.07,0:18:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,(未授权用户)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.37,0:19:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.76,0:19:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,十年前在蜂巢...地球再无一人幸存...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}10 years ago in the Hive... There will be no survivors...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这是哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.57,0:19:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我在哪  回答我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where am I? Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.77,0:19:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们怎么了  - 安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's wrong with you? -  Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是谁干的  - 安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who did this? -  Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.49,0:19:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.26,0:19:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.68,0:20:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你终于醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're awake at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.30,0:20:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我明明杀了你  - 然而我就在你眼前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I killed you. -  Yet here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是克隆人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A clone...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我杀了你的克隆  - 你是我最大的麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I killed your clone. -  You've been most troublesome to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.85,0:20:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你和你的姐妹们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and your sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.65,0:20:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我抓到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now I have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.29,0:20:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,清除计划早该在一年前完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cleansing operation should've finished over a year ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.88,0:20:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但你拖慢了我们的进度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you slowed us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.23,0:20:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,所以  我不得不亲自指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So much so, that I was obliged to take command myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以结束这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could end all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.68,0:20:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,为何不呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.25,0:20:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.07,0:20:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,有人跟你说了什么  不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone told you something, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.10,0:20:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你很快就会求着告诉我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well, you'll be begging to tell me soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.91,0:20:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,她是无神者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's an unbeliever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.44,0:20:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎么处理无神者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do with unbelievers?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.77,0:20:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,驱逐她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cast her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.07,0:21:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,驱逐她  驱逐她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cast her out! Cast her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.15,0:21:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来吧  - 驱逐她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! -  Cast her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.24,0:21:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,驱逐她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cast her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.02,0:21:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,驱逐她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cast her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.60,0:21:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,驱逐她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cast her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.92,0:21:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,驱逐她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cast her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.19,0:21:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,驱逐她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cast her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.33,0:21:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,驱逐她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cast her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.30,0:21:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,驱逐她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cast her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.81,0:22:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝创造了一场洪水来净化地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God created a flood to cleanse the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,40个日夜的大雨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}40 days and 40 nights of rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.49,0:22:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的方法花的时间稍微长点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our method is taking a little longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.04,0:22:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但结果会是一样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the result will be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.38,0:22:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,留下一个干净纯粹的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A world ready for the righteous and the pure to inherit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.54,0:22:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将在12小时后抵达浣熊市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We reach Raccoon City in just over 12 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.65,0:22:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我怀疑即便是你也跑不了那么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I doubt even you can run for that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.95,0:22:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我要知道你知道些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to know what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.94,0:22:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,她愿意开口时告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me when she's ready to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.83,0:22:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 威斯克  - 艾萨克斯博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wesker. -  Dr. Isaacs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.55,0:22:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,看我在路边找到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what I found on the roadside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.06,0:22:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你的华盛顿任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would appear your mission to
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.23,0:22:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没有你说的那么成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Washington was less successful than you made out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.79,0:22:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.73,0:23:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你没有再留下别的祸根了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you didn't leave any other loose ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.21,0:23:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,除此之外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.44,0:23:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我想她知道了空气传播病毒抗体的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think she knows about the airborne antivirus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.74,0:23:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么可能  - 我还不知道  暂时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How can that be? -  I don't know. Yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.46,0:23:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们是在去浣熊市的路上抓到的她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we caught her on the road to Raccoon City.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.98,0:23:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,她去那还能有什么原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why else would she be headed there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.40,0:23:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,把蜂巢的安保级别升至最高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raise the security level at the Hive to maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.93,0:23:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,任何人不得进出  她开口了我会告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one in or out. I'll let you know when she talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.68,0:23:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝与你同在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.21,0:23:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你听见他说的了  安保级别升至最高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard him. Security level to maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.00,0:23:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如你所愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.32,0:23:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,上去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up there and check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.43,0:25:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,给我解开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.91,0:25:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把它们解开  - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Open them. -  Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.18,0:25:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.36,0:26:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你骑不了它  你逃不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't use it. You can't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.78,0:26:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,向她开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire at her!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.40,0:27:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.07,0:27:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.75,0:27:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,她逃跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.08,0:27:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,(目标爱丽丝  安保卫星A43)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.84,0:28:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,目标还有116公里  正在逼近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target is 72 miles and closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.03,0:28:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,封锁蜂巢  准备防御措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock down the Hive. Prepare defensive measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.54,0:28:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,通知浣熊市的特勤人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And alert our operative in Raccoon City.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.14,0:28:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,(欢迎来到浣熊市  保护伞之家)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.99,0:28:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.44,0:29:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,空气传播抗体病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Airborne antivirus...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.86,0:29:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,48小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}48 hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.21,0:29:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,进入蜂巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it to the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.45,0:29:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,放开他  放开他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go! Let him go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.29,0:29:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,快放下否则我们开枪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it down or we'll shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.87,0:29:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我早说了的  医生  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, Doc!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.94,0:29:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静  克里斯汀  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm down, Christian!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.87,0:29:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就说你错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you you were wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.48,0:29:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.28,0:29:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们早该在有机会的时候杀了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should've killed her when we had the chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.40,0:29:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,放下  拜托  在他还没射杀我俩之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it down, please. Before he tries to shoot the both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.79,0:29:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这里面是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.37,0:29:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 纯肾上腺素  我需要叫醒你  - 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pure adrenaline. I needed you awake. -  Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.41,0:29:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有东西要来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.55,0:29:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,在你进来的方向  大家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the same direction you came in. Something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.45,0:30:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,放了他  快放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go! Put it down, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.77,0:30:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.39,0:30:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,保护伞公司在阿卡迪亚抓住了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Umbrella captured me at the Arcadia.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.40,0:30:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被押往一处叫蜂巢的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were headed somewhere called the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.35,0:30:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,挣脱捆绑  杀了飞行员  坠毁在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got loose, killed the pilot. Crashed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.61,0:30:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,医生跟其他人把我从残骸中救了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc and the others pulled me from the crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.18,0:30:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我欠他们一条命  - 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I owe them my life. -  Doc!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.56,0:30:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,在那  东边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.53,0:30:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,仍然冲着我们这过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's still headed our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.60,0:30:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道那是什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.01,0:30:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,保护伞公司  艾萨克斯博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Umbrella. Doctor Isaacs.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.24,0:30:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你已经杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought that you killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.56,0:30:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我也以为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought so, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.48,0:30:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他有支僵尸军队  几小时内就会到这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has an army of undead with him. He'll be here within hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.43,0:30:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们怎么办  - 我们为什么要问她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do we do? -  Why the hell are we asking her?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.36,0:30:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,她是个陌生人  我们不能信任她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a stranger. We shouldn't have trust her...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.73,0:30:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  我才不管...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I don't care...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.11,0:30:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰我  医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you touch me, Doc!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.65,0:30:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把枪放下  克里斯汀  - 你把枪放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Put it down! Christian! -  You put it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.07,0:30:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你先放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You put it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.95,0:30:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我  就因为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me. Just cause you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.12,0:30:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得自己应该当老大  并不代表你就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}think you should be in charge, doesn't make it so.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.70,0:31:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我听好了  医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You listen to me, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.88,0:31:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你会后悔的  你们都会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna regret it. All of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.81,0:31:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都会后悔的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.34,0:31:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须得去蜂巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to get to the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.03,0:31:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你得带他们离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to get these people out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.73,0:31:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这有孩子  伤员还有老人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have children. Injured. The elderly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.90,0:31:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,跑出去他们哪还有生还的可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now what chance do they have on the open road?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.69,0:31:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,概率总比待在这里的大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better than they have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.72,0:31:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这栋楼很安全  - 或许是不怕僵尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This building is secure. -  Maybe from the undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.12,0:31:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但艾萨克斯有装甲车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Isaacs has armored vehicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.12,0:31:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,火箭发射器  还有重机枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocket launchers, heavy ordinance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.51,0:31:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会把这里夷为平地的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna tear this place wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.40,0:31:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.91,0:31:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,她怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what happened to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.85,0:32:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,她中了我们在防线上设置的一处陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's set off one of the traps we had on perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.68,0:32:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不是给僵尸准备的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not intended for the undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.86,0:32:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么  - 当日特饮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is this? -  Specialty of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.70,0:32:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,能让你立马振作起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you in your feet in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.18,0:32:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should I trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.32,0:32:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.67,0:32:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,医生  麻烦你出来一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc, you need to get out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.65,0:32:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都很害怕  克里斯汀完全在帮倒忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are scared and Christian's not helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.71,0:32:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得让大家清楚状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to let people know what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.40,0:32:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.30,0:32:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.27,0:32:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你朋友不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Your friend's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.89,0:32:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.85,0:32:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他和我...  - 看出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know, he and I... -  I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.05,0:32:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂巢里有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what's in the Hive?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.23,0:32:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,保护伞公司研究出了解药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Umbrella developed a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.75,0:32:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,一种空气传播的抗体病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An airborne antivirus.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.25,0:33:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,一经接触就能摧毁T病毒感染过的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll destroy anything infected with the T-Virus on contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.86,0:33:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁告诉你的  你竟然相信她  - 红后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who told you this? And you believed her? -  The Red Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.33,0:33:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们能结束这一切呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if we could end all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.14,0:33:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那你呢  他们也给你注射了T病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you? They infected you with the T-Virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.48,0:33:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你要释放的这种病毒抗体也会杀死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You release this antivirus, it's going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.75,0:33:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不在乎  - 爱丽丝  我不...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whatever it takes. -  Alice, I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.26,0:33:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.32,0:33:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.00,0:33:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们先打败艾萨克斯  救下这些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We stop Isaacs here. We save these people,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.88,0:33:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们一起去蜂巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then we go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.53,0:33:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们时间不多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have long.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.13,0:33:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,开始行动吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.52,0:33:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你们还有什么可供防御的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else do you have for defense?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.21,0:33:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,没有太多枪支  但有充足的汽油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not too many firearms, we have a big supply of gasoline.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.07,0:34:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,给  你需要一把武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. You need a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.07,0:34:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都给她枪了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're giving her a gun now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.33,0:34:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别激动  克里斯汀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy, Christian.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.69,0:34:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你尽可以降低警惕  但我不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can let your guard down if you want, man. I don't intend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.61,0:34:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我骑车到这的时候  有人在盯着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I rode in here, someone was watching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.26,0:34:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他本来可以大喊或开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They could've called out or fired
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.32,0:34:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,来提醒我这里有陷阱  但他没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a shot to warn me about the trap but they didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.09,0:34:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么意思  - 当心背后有人捅刀子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you saying? -  Watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.95,0:34:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,艾萨克斯博士  看来你又让她逃脱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Dr. Isaacs, it seems you let her slip through your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.02,0:34:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他们很多人都还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot remains of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.37,0:34:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了你在跟谁说话  她在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget who you're talking to. Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.87,0:34:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,浣熊市的一个据点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A settlement in Raccoon City.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.55,0:34:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,据线人汇报  她正在准备战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our informant reports that she's preparing for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.31,0:34:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  我一个小时就到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. I'll be there in the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.12,0:35:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,(主说  复仇将属于我)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.72,0:35:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样  继续推\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.82,0:35:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要所有的汽油桶  放那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need all the gasoline cans. Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.13,0:35:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克莱尔说这是你建的  - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Claire said you built this. -  That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.03,0:35:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这本来是一台窗户清洗器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This used to be a window washer.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.97,0:35:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我做了点改装  - 你在哪儿学的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I made a couple of changes. -  Where did you learn to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.90,0:35:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸以前开了一家拆车厂  我讨厌它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father used to run a chop shop. I hated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.33,0:35:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道呢  开来当时还是有在认真学吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knew? I guess I was paying attention after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.69,0:35:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  我想让你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Because I'm gonna need you
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.21,0:35:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,把这东西再改装一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to make a few more changes to this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.46,0:36:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,武器就位  装填高爆炸药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready the weapons. High explosive rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.18,0:36:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不留活口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.25,0:36:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.23,0:36:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他们来了  关上大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming! Close the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.86,0:36:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊  这简直是支军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God. It's an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.80,0:36:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.36,0:37:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  我们要怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.79,0:37:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们杀光他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna kill every last one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.63,0:37:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,准备开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.14,0:37:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.68,0:37:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,点火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Light it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.68,0:37:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.75,0:37:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.28,0:38:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,操他妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn her!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.26,0:38:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,再次装填\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reload.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.57,0:38:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,靠边  全面停止进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close it up. Full stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.84,0:38:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,放出诱饵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release the bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.45,0:38:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有幸存者  打开大门  - 打开大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's a survivor. Open the gate. -  Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.97,0:38:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,开火  给她打掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open fire! Keep them off her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.73,0:38:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,第二发就绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marker 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.94,0:38:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.56,0:38:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔  医生  出去把她带进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire, Doc, get out there. Bring her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.82,0:38:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.00,0:39:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.11,0:39:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,她快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.28,0:39:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.95,0:39:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的  关上大门  快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn you. Close the gate now!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.04,0:39:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔  他们突破大门了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire, they've breached the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.38,0:39:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.24,0:39:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.02,0:39:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞瑟尔  现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Razor, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.40,0:39:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命  你们听到她说的了  推\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right! You heard her. Push!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.34,0:40:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.92,0:40:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃大门  撤回到路障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abandon the gate. Pull back to the barricades.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.38,0:40:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,看来她没新招了  瞄准屋顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like she's out of tricks. Target the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.34,0:40:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.60,0:40:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.63,0:40:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝  我们到路障了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice! We're at the barricades.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.40,0:40:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔  你们必须挡住它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire, you have to hold them there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.45,0:41:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doc!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.34,0:41:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝  我们撑不了多久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice! We can't hold on much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.00,0:41:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,马上撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of there, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.37,0:42:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,补给弹药  快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back up. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.45,0:43:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,对她集中所有火力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring all guns to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.99,0:43:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.06,0:43:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,她在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.07,0:43:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,她去哪儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where have she gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.51,0:43:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,找到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.22,0:43:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,关闭通风口  快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close the vents! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.26,0:43:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,别开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.35,0:44:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你动作很快  但你不够机智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're fast, but you're not too smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.00,0:45:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别开枪  拜托  - 他在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't shoot, please. -  Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.23,0:45:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That way.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.30,0:45:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,省着点弹药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save your ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.38,0:45:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意儿实在太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's too many of these things still out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.08,0:45:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我来解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.04,0:45:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.89,0:45:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 出发  - 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move out. -  Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.67,0:45:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,享受旅程吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enjoy the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.09,0:46:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 伙计们  - 你们过来看看 说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Guys. There's something here you gotta see. -  Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.35,0:46:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有两支丧尸军团朝我们过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two more armies of undead. Headed straight for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.94,0:46:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,地平线这里一支\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There. On the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.08,0:46:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,还有这里一支\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a second over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.19,0:46:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没汽油了  已经无力防御\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're out of gasoline. We're defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.41,0:46:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须赶到蜂巢  这是唯一的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to make it to the Hive. It's our only chance now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.84,0:46:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我和你一起去  - 算我一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll come with you. -  Count me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.67,0:46:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.74,0:46:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.39,0:46:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前误会你了  倒霉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wrong about you. Blow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.54,0:46:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道你们要去哪儿  进入深井\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know where you're going. Into the pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.85,0:46:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,请让我们加入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We want to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.06,0:46:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.53,0:46:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,带上些装备  你们会用得着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab some gear. You're gonna need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.32,0:47:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.35,0:47:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.12,0:47:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,爆炸后一部分暴露出来的蜂巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The part of the Hive exposed by the blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.48,0:47:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就从那儿进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's our way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.82,0:47:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行动  - 我打头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's move! -  I'll take point.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.90,0:47:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,(爱丽丝计划)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.52,0:48:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,(保护伞公司  蜂巢)
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.67,0:48:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,启动安全监测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activate security measures now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.43,0:48:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂巢安保系统已完全启动并进入自动操作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hive security fully activated and automated.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.93,0:48:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.32,0:48:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,退出自动操作  我亲自操作防御系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disengage automation. I'll handle the defenses myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.01,0:48:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,由我来控制防御系统会更有效率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Defenses will be more efficient if I retain control of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.07,0:48:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗  我好像记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? I seem to remember
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.40,0:48:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,上次她从这儿活着出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}last time she was here she walked out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.48,0:48:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再犯同样的错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't intend to make that same mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.70,0:48:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,如你所愿  蜂巢防御系统现在由你掌控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you wish. Hive defenses are now in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.31,0:48:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,放出地狱犬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unleash the Cerberus.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.00,0:48:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱犬上场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cerberus on play.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.47,0:48:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前有亲人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you have someone? Before all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.45,0:48:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,丈夫  家庭什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Husband? Family?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.49,0:48:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不记得了  - 怎么可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can't remember. -  How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.16,0:48:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我醒来的时候这一切已经开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I woke up just when all of this was starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.77,0:48:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,之前的事想不太起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't recall much before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.16,0:49:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候我觉得这就是我生活的全部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes I feel like this has been my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.78,0:49:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,亡命天涯  杀戮不息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Running. Killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.11,0:49:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了  - 有东西跟着我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? -  Something's stalking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.10,0:49:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你确定  - 我就是干这行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you sure? -  This is what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.23,0:49:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.17,0:49:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run, fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.99,0:51:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.10,0:51:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,都还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.70,0:51:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.14,0:51:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.65,0:52:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,它们怎么停下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd they stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.73,0:52:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 也许它们是害怕了  - 怕什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe they're scared. -  Scared of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.15,0:52:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,怕那下面的什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever's down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.88,0:52:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,(最高警戒  密闭门)
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.03,0:52:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,封闭蜂巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seal the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.87,0:52:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,(启动封闭程序)
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.98,0:52:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.45,0:52:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.33,0:53:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧  - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You okay? -  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.62,0:53:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我弹夹已经空了一半了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mag's half empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.68,0:53:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我把枪落在湖里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lost my guns at the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.95,0:53:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我只剩枪膛里的子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only got one round left.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.35,0:53:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有一个备用弹夹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One spare mag and then I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.60,0:53:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,没枪没弹药  我们下来干吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No guns, no ammo, what the hell are we gonna do down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.26,0:53:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝  灯怎么灭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice. What's with the lights?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.89,0:53:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂巢有一部分受损\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a part of the Hive that's damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.95,0:53:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 电力不稳定  - 拿上这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Power's erratic. -  Here. Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.17,0:53:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.17,0:54:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前问我为什么背叛保护伞公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You asked why I'd turn against Umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.59,0:54:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我承诺过会告诉你原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I promised you an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.48,0:54:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,在T病毒泄露后不久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon after the T-Virus was released,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.89,0:54:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,一份机密文件上传到了我的数据流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a secret file was uploaded to my data stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.97,0:54:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那是一份病毒爆发前17个月召开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a recording of a meeting of the Umbrella High Command.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.41,0:54:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,保护伞公司高层会议的记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dated 17 months before the viral outbreak occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.68,0:54:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们今天在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here today,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.00,0:54:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不仅要讨论公司的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not just to talk about the future of this company.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.29,0:54:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也要讨论它的使命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here to talk about its destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.55,0:54:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,以及世界的终结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here to talk about the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.30,0:54:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就站在末日边缘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We stand on the brink of Armageddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.47,0:54:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们承受着无法治愈的疾病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diseases for which we have no cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.37,0:54:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,原教旨主义自求毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fundamentalist states who call for our destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.25,0:54:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,面对核武器我们束手无策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nuclear powers over which we have no control.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.46,0:54:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,即使我们渡过这一切的难关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And even if we navigate these dangerous waters,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.29,0:54:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,还是会面临其他更不可避免的威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we face other even more inevitable threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.53,0:54:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,全球变暖将在80年内融化两极的冰盖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Global warming will melt the polar ice caps within 80 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.60,0:54:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,淹没地球上90%的可居住地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}flooding 90 % of all habitable areas on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.98,0:54:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,要不了50年  食物产量就会无法供应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unchecked population growth will overtake
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.42,0:55:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,疯狂增长的人口将导致饥荒和战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}food production in less than 50 years leading to famine and war.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.32,0:55:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是猜测  而是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not conjecture. This is a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.66,0:55:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,无论怎样  我们的世界正在走向终结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One way or another, our world is coming to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.13,0:55:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,问题在于  我们要随之一起灭绝吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The question is, will we end with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.07,0:55:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么提议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you propose?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.62,0:55:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我提议由我们来终结世界...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I propose that we end the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.65,0:55:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,以我们的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But on our terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.79,0:55:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,进行一场精心策划的世界末日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An orchestrated apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.94,0:55:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,清除地球上的人口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One that would cleanse the world of its' population
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.47,0:55:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但完整保留其基础设施和资源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but leave its infrastructure and resources intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.64,0:55:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这一想法曾经成功实施过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been done once before. With great success.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.65,0:55:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,被选中的少数人将会度过这场灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chosen few will ride out the storm,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.48,0:55:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不是在创世纪中的诺亚方舟上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not in an ark as in the book of Genesis, but in safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.92,0:55:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,而是在安全的地下  当末日结束后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Underground. And when it's over,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.50,0:55:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会回到一个净化过的地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will emerge onto a cleansed Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.46,0:55:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,重建我们想象中的辉煌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One we can then reboot. In our image.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.51,0:55:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算怎么实现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And just how do you intend to achieve this?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.04,0:56:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,救世之法已然就绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The means of our salvation are already at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.49,0:56:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,请看  T病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give to you, the T-virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.51,0:56:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是故意泄露的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They released it deliberately.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.97,0:56:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这份记录传到我数据流的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When this recording was uploaded to my data stream,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.82,0:56:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,对我的程序造成了冲突\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it created a conflict in my programming.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.68,0:56:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我被创造出来为保护伞公司服务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was created to serve the Umbrella Corporation,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.66,0:56:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但也被设定为是珍视人类生命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I was also programmed to value human life.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.03,0:56:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,艾萨克斯博士准许病毒泄露\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Isaacs allowed the virus to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.75,0:56:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他杀害了70亿人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He murdered over 7 billion people.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.38,0:56:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我的程序不允许我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My programming will not allow me
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.13,0:56:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,伤害保护伞公司的员工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to harm an employee of the Umbrella Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.00,0:56:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法阻止艾萨克斯博士  但你可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am powerless to stop Dr. Isaacs, but you are not.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.09,0:56:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,37分钟后  最后一个人类据点也将被摧毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In 37 minutes, the last of the human settlements will fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.28,0:56:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,无人能够生还\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There will be no survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.60,0:56:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is imperative
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.74,0:56:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,发生之前释放病毒抗体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you release the antivirus before this occurs,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.35,0:56:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,否则保护伞公司就赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or Umbrella will have won.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.84,0:56:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,最后还有一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is one last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.17,0:56:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你面前有一个耳机  戴上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is an earpiece in front of you. Put it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.60,0:57:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法亲自动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot, in my actions,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.05,0:57:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,去伤害保护伞公司的员工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}harm an employee of the Umbrella Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.95,0:57:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但我可以告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I can tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.03,0:57:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,保护伞公司在浣熊市有个线人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Umbrella had an informant in Raccoon City.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.56,0:57:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,而这个人现在很有可能就在你队里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is highly likely that this person is now here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.99,0:57:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,时间不多了  爱丽丝  动作要快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time is running out, Alice. You have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.69,0:57:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,(爱丽丝计划)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.62,0:57:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,(保护伞公司  蜂巢)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.78,0:57:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,(浣熊市)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.76,0:57:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你  艾萨克斯博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad to see you, Dr. Isaacs.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.88,0:57:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还以为上次袭击后无人生还\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't think there'd be any survivors after that last attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.41,0:58:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 水  - 给艾萨克斯博士倒杯水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Water. -  Yes, of course. Get Dr. Isaacs some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.85,0:58:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 然后原路返回浣熊市  - 她不在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Then resume course for Raccoon City. -  She's not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.59,0:58:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么  - 她去了深井  跟上她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? -  She went to the pit. We have to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.67,0:58:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我接到的命令不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are not my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.73,0:58:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我有严格的... - 我们必须去深井\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have strict... -  We have to go to the pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.31,0:58:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.37,0:58:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是哪儿  - 是蜂巢的一个进气口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is this place? -  It's an air intake for the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.44,0:58:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,跟上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.60,0:58:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧  真要去啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.69,0:59:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这里安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.06,1:00:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,快  电力要恢复了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up! The power's coming back on!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.72,1:00:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克莱尔  - 快  我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Claire! -  Hurry! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.66,1:00:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.69,1:00:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.56,1:00:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧  - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You all right? -  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.34,1:00:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在监视我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's watching us.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.98,1:00:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,反向旋转涡轮片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reverse polarity of the turbine.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.28,1:01:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,金属片在向反方向旋转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The plates are going the other way.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.32,1:01:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.61,1:01:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,金属片在向后吸气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The plates are sucking the air backwards!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.88,1:01:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.18,1:01:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,快快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.13,1:04:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.15,1:04:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.30,1:04:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.54,1:05:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.73,1:07:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞瑟尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Razor?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.23,1:07:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.24,1:07:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.92,1:07:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.68,1:10:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么玩意儿  - 生物武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell was that? -  Bio-weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.41,1:10:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是个人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one's human.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.48,1:10:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你见到克莱尔了吗  - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you seen Claire? -  No.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.37,1:10:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 瑞瑟尔呢  - 死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Razor? -  He didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.32,1:10:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.39,1:10:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得抓紧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.64,1:10:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,如果目标继续按此路线行进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the target continues on her present course,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.48,1:10:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,她将于七分钟内到达这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she'll be here in under 7 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.68,1:10:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,唤醒他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.24,1:10:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我被写入的指令是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My instructions aren't to do so,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.97,1:10:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,仅在最紧急情况才能这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only in the greatest of emergencies.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.62,1:10:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,立刻唤醒他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake them now!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.58,1:10:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,(警告  前方道路尽头)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.45,1:10:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,(警告  前方道路尽头)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.31,1:11:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,(警告  危险  全部系统故障)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.14,1:11:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,(警告  危险  全部系统故障)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.86,1:11:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.72,1:12:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得赶紧离开这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.08,1:12:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着  我们要切断电源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. We're stopping power.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.82,1:12:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快没时间了  - 接下来去哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Time's running out. -  Where to next?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.85,1:12:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂巢的最底层就在我们脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The final level of the Hive's below us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.56,1:12:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要怎么下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we get down there?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.79,1:12:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.71,1:13:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这些都是什么  - 低温冷藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are they? -  Cryogenic storage.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.45,1:13:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿得有成千上万人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must be thousands of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.68,1:13:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,全都是保护伞的高层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Umbrella High Command.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.34,1:13:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,安全地等待末日天启的结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waiting out the apocalypse in safety.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.05,1:13:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,权贵之人的诺亚方舟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Noah's Ark for the rich, and powerful.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.88,1:13:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你要干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.71,1:13:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,搭把手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.45,1:13:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it done?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.34,1:13:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 清除计划完成了吗  - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The cleansing process is complete? -  No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.80,1:14:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那为什么唤醒我  - 有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Then why am I awake? -  We had a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.28,1:14:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我尽力...  - 别废话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I tried... -  Save your breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.57,1:14:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know exactly what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.46,1:14:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,出了个叛徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been betrayed.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.33,1:14:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.88,1:14:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,来我这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.54,1:14:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,来  都过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.23,1:14:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.62,1:15:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.65,1:15:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,坏孩子回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bad seed returns.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.08,1:15:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,还是说浪子回头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or is it the prodigal daughter?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.99,1:15:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,别傻站在那儿了  过来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, don't just stand there. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.54,1:16:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟你只剩九分钟拯救世界了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all, you have only 9 minutes to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.33,1:16:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你是本体吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're really him?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.24,1:16:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,事情一件一件办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First things first,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.11,1:16:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你先把武器放到地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna need you to place your weapons on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.62,1:16:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我凭什么听你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I wanna do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.34,1:16:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是想要这个  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what you're after, yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.15,1:16:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,抗病毒剂  终结这一切的解药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Antivirus. The cure to all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.25,1:16:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,然而只有这么一管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's only one vial.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.85,1:16:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在地下八百米的密封设施里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're half a mile underground in a sealed facility.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.57,1:16:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我一摔  抗病毒剂没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I drop it here, the antivirus goes nowhere,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.42,1:16:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你的妄想只会更快灰飞烟灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your hopeless dreams will die sooner rather than later.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.25,1:16:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这才乖嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.83,1:16:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还没放下枪  - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're still armed. -  Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.03,1:16:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱尔得多么失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claire would be so disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.34,1:16:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,再过几分钟  克莱尔就死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a few minutes, Claire will be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.41,1:16:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,和其他你认识的人一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Along with everybody else you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.06,1:16:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真动听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.94,1:17:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. My love.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.63,1:17:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,把武器和起爆器都放下  离远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move away from the weapon. And the detonator. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.96,1:17:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,她在储藏高管的冷冻室安了炸药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She placed explosives in the High Command cryo tubes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.63,1:17:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我去拆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll disarm them.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.59,1:17:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢  你做得很好  医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. You've done well, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.84,1:17:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,省省吧  你拿不到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't bother. You don't make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.51,1:17:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,碎冰锥  酒瓶  还有钢笔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the ice pick, the decanter or the fountain pen.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.63,1:18:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,(格斗预测软件)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.31,1:18:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,(消灭目标概率:100%)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.76,1:18:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,然后  你的问题的答案是  是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, in answer to your question, yes...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.09,1:18:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,除去做过的几处技术性升级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}apart from a few technological upgrades,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.50,1:18:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是亚历山大·罗兰德·艾萨克斯博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Dr. Alexander Roland Isaacs.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.39,1:18:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,本体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The original.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.23,1:18:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我在外面遇到的那位  他也是这么认为的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one I met out there, he thought exactly the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.80,1:18:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那当然  他们的设定就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course he did. That's how they're designed.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.34,1:18:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,只要让他们自认为自己是本体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They always try harder and fight longer even to death
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.65,1:18:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就会拼了命厮杀至死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as long as they think they're the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.47,1:18:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟谁会想知道自己只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all, who wants to know they're
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.03,1:18:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的仿造品  无用的复制品呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just a poor imitation, or a worthless copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.20,1:18:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,和你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which brings us to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.60,1:18:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不  - 得了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. -  Oh come now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.91,1:19:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得你自己是本体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You thought you were the original.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.83,1:19:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,太可爱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How delicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.04,1:19:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不  恐怕这位才能冠此殊荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm afraid she holds that dubious honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.76,1:19:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽西亚·马库斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alicia Marcus,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.36,1:19:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我的老搭档詹姆斯的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}daughter of my old partner, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.40,1:19:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,保护伞公司的共有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Co-owner of the Umbrella Corporation
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.64,1:19:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,也是我的眼中钉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a painful thorn in my side.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.96,1:19:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我想除掉的绊脚石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I now intend to remove.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.91,1:19:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,快没时间了  爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time, is running out, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.55,1:19:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须马上杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must kill him soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.72,1:19:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我也很高兴见到你  爱丽西亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to see you too, Alicia.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.01,1:19:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,马库斯为了救她研发出了T病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marcus created the T-Virus to save her
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.83,1:19:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜效果并不持久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the effects didn't last.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.43,1:19:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在等着她死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been waiting years for her to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.10,1:19:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.21,1:19:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不是克隆人  - 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not a clone. -  Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.57,1:19:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定会奇怪为什么你想不起童年的事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must've wondered why you remember nothing of your childhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.50,1:19:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你的父亲  你的母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father. Your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.13,1:19:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我失忆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Memory loss.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.26,1:19:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不  你没有记忆是因为你没有经历过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You have no memory because you had no life.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.52,1:20:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们十年前创造出你的之前全都是空白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing before the mansion, when we created you, 10 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.51,1:20:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我知道我是谁  - 我可不这么觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know who I am. -  I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.14,1:20:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你只不过是一只断了线的木偶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're nothing more than a puppet whose strings were cut.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.23,1:20:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,到处晃悠了一阵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then you wandered around for a little while
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.42,1:20:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就自以为是真人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thinking you were a real girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.67,1:20:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,可你并不是  你只是个聪明的克隆体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're not. You're just a clever imitation.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.21,1:20:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,复制品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A facsimile.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.09,1:20:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,让人头疼的复制品罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A rather troublesome one at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.02,1:20:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lying to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.88,1:20:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他说的是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid he's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.87,1:20:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你是以她的模样创造的  我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were created in her image, as was I.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.13,1:20:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我的模样和声音都提取自\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My likeness and voice were based on
