Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.45,1:33:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,(生命体征:0%)
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.81,1:33:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是本体  他不是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm me. He's not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.48,1:35:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你做到了  爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did it. Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.55,1:35:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.09,1:35:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.77,1:35:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why am I still alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.92,1:35:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.86,1:35:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事  - 艾萨克斯死后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened? -  When Isaacs died,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.59,1:35:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我就能重新上线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could bring myself back online
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.64,1:35:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,阻止了对幸存者聚集地的攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and stop the attacks on the remaining human settlements.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.90,1:35:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你拯救了他们  - 我为什么还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You saved them. -  Why am I still alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.73,1:35:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,抗病毒剂只摧毁了你体内的T病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Antivirus only destroyed the T-Virus within your body.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.37,1:35:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,而不会损害健康细胞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It didn't harm the healthy cells.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.74,1:36:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在已经不受感染了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are now free of infection.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.60,1:36:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我会死  你和爱丽西亚...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I would die. You and Alicia...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.67,1:36:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们骗了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.79,1:36:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得确定你是否\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had to know if you were willing to
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.40,1:36:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,愿意牺牲自己  拯救他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}make the sacrifice, to give up your life for others.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.63,1:36:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,保护伞公司的其他人绝不可能这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was something no one at Umbrella would've done.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.59,1:36:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽西亚·马库斯没看错人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alicia Marcus was right about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.16,1:36:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你比他们好得多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were better than all of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.97,1:36:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我也曾是其中一员  我是保护伞创造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was one of them. I was created by Umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.07,1:36:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我只是他们的工具  - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just an instrument for them. -  No.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.10,1:36:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你远远超出了他们的预期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You became something more than they could ever have anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.11,1:36:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,克隆人比人类更有人性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The clone became more human than they ever could be.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.58,1:36:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你还有最后一件事要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you have one more step to make.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.96,1:36:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.04,1:36:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽西亚在她死前下载了她的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before she died, Alicia downloaded her memories,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.04,1:36:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,为你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.44,1:36:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你从未有过的童年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The childhood you never had.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.61,1:36:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,与她没能成为的你合为一体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Combined with the woman she could never become.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.25,1:37:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,T病毒传遍地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the T-Virus spread across the Earth,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.63,1:37:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是靠的现代科技的速度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it did so at the speed of the modern world.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.02,1:37:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,借以遍布全球的喷气式飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carried by jetliners across the globe.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.76,1:37:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,抗病毒剂依靠空气传播  只能靠风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The antivirus is airborne, spread by the winds.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.50,1:37:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,得花上好几年才能遍布世界各地的角落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could take years for it to reach every corner of the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.52,1:37:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之前  我的使命尚未完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until then, my work is not done.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.66,1:37:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Alice.
